  "dry_snp_activity": "On the Newcastlemax sector, the “HL Frontier” - 208K/2010 Universal was sold for USD 32.5 mills basis delivery in May with SS/DD due. The Post-Panamax “Cora Oldendorff” - 93K/2012 Taizhou Catic was sold for USD 13.8 mills to Chinese buyers, while the Post- Panamax “Petalon” - 87K/2010 Hudong Zhonghua was also sold to Chinese for USD 10.9 mills. Chinese buyers acquired also the Kamsarmax “Ellina” - 83K/2008 Tsu- neishi Zhoushan for USD 12.75 mills. On the Supramax sector the OHBS “Pacific Infinity” - 56K/2012 Oshima changed hands for USD 16.85 mills, whilst the “Evropi”- 54K/2005 Xiamen found new owners for 7.5 mills. Last but not least, Greek buyers acquired the Handysize “DL Marigold”- 34K/2012 Samjin and the “DL Tulip” - 34K/2012 Samjin were sold for high USD 9 mills each.",
